OL,3,GNEWSAWorking men's club 'deeply        
OL,4,Aaffected' by coach death               
OL,6,FBosses at a working men's club said    
OL,7,Fthey have been left "deeply affected"  
OL,8,Fafter one if its members was hit by a  
OL,9,Fcoach and killed at a service station  
OL,10,Fin Lancashire.                         
OL,12,FReleasing a statement with more detail,
OL,13,FThurcroft Miners Institute, based in   
OL,14,FRotherham, Yorkshire, said the man was 
OL,15,Fstanding behind the coach as it was    
OL,16,Freversing - with its driver believing  
OL,17,Fall passengers had alighted.           
OL,19,FPolice were called to the incident at  
OL,20,FRivington services near Chorley at     
OL,21,F14:30 GMT on Sunday, when the victim   
OL,22,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.      
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
