OL,3,GNEWSAWorking men's club 'deeply        
OL,4,Aaffected' by coach death               
OL,6,FThe club added: "Our thoughts and      
OL,7,Fsympathies go out to the deceased's    
OL,8,Ffamily, friends, and those members who 
OL,9,Fare affected by this tragic accident." 
